    "markdown": "---\nengine: knitr\n---\n\n# Variable rules\n![](/images/cargo_container.png){style=\"width:200px; background:white; border-radius:5px; border: white 5px solid\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n__<u id='variable'>Variables</u>__ are used to store information which can then be referenced or manipulated later. \nIt is useful to label data with descriptive names which are easily read by humans. \nYou can think of a __<u id='variable'>variable</u>__ as a 'container' to hold a piece of information. \n  \n__<u id='variable'>Variables</u>__ are assigned a value using the equals (`=`) character.\n\n__<u id='variable'>Variable</u> name rules__:\n\n- Must start with either a letter or an underscore\n  - Cannot start with a number\n- Must only contain alphanumeric characters (and underscores)\n  - No punctuation such as full stops, quotes, commas, colons, etc. are allowed\n- They are case sensitive\n\nPython supports several <u id='class'>classes</u> (or types) of __<u id='variable'>variables</u>__ including __<u id='string'>strings</u>__, __<u id='integer'>integers</u>__, __<u id='float'>floats</u>__, and __<u id='boolean'>booleans</u>__.\n\nIn a new __Markdown cell__ add the following:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\n### Variables\n#### Strings\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-650fea02601b121845b4\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-650fea02601b121845b4\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs specific tasks\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-e389adc0d7d16880d4cb\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-e389adc0d7d16880d4cb\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, *, /, and more\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-81c94ebef98372a11efe\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-81c94ebef98372a11efe\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text, denoted by quotes (\\\"text\\\" or 'text')\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8871d68c052a6c9d73a8\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8871d68c052a6c9d73a8\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Whole numbers, e.g. 1, 2, 3, etc\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1f8e58fc9aeb17f42149\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1f8e58fc9aeb17f42149\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"float\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Real numbers (can contain decimal point), e.g. 1, 2.5, 3.14, etc\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-3ca251e67e302f28a56e\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-3ca251e67e302f28a56e\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"boolean\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"True or False\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-bfe08491221c97d24ded\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-bfe08491221c97d24ded\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of information with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a513b2fe1b4c13587bc6\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a513b2fe1b4c13587bc6\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Type of data, e.g. string, integer, float, boolean, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
